<http://data.silknow.org/object/79cc9215-aba7-3a94-8360-6454c9220a78>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of figured silk. With a small scale design of sprays of white flowers and a network of scrolling blue fronds on a pale blue ground. The flower spray contains one trumpet-shaped flower and a multiple stem of tiny flowers. It is repeated in reverse in a half-drop repeat. The silks are Jacquard woven. Tabby ground with a warp of blue silk and weft of white silk. Warp twill for the blue fronds. The white flowers are formed by floating on the surface a proportion of the weft."@en , "Dress fabric of Jacquard woven silk, possibly woven at Spitalfields, 1825-1880."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/6a690442-09b9-300e-bdfc-ae3b78c244c8> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of Jacquard woven silk, possibly woven at Spitalfields, 1825-1880."@en , "Dress fabric of figured silk. With a small scale design of sprays of white flowers and a network of scrolling blue fronds on a pale blue ground. The flower spray contains one trumpet-shaped flower and a multiple stem of tiny flowers. It is repeated in reverse in a half-drop repeat. The silks are Jacquard woven. Tabby ground with a warp of blue silk and weft of white silk. Warp twill for the blue fronds. The white flowers are formed by floating on the surface a proportion of the weft."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/79cc9215-aba7-3a94-8360-6454c9220a78/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/79cc9215-aba7-3a94-8360-6454c9220a78/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/79cc9215-aba7-3a94-8360-6454c9220a78/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/79cc9215-aba7-3a94-8360-6454c9220a78/dimension/2> ;
